WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.207
Week 15: Health, Body, and Emergencies. describe symptoms understand basic medical questions request urgent help

2
00:00:08.207 --> 00:00:14.623
Mission brief. Call for help, explain what happened, and answer a clinician’s intake questions.

3
00:00:14.623 --> 00:00:24.006
Preparation. Select ten useful words, three linking expressions, and two repair phrases. Plan points rather than a memorized paragraph.

4
00:00:24.006 --> 00:00:31.701
Performance. Complete the task once for fluency, review the evidence, then repeat it for greater clarity and accuracy.

5
00:00:31.701 --> 00:00:40.143
After-action review. Record what succeeded, what blocked communication, and the single change that will matter most on the next attempt.

6
00:00:40.143 --> 00:01:07.617
Model language. Voy a pedir ayuda de inmediato. — I am going to ask for help immediately. Explico lo ocurrido con calma. — I explain what happened calmly. Respondo cada pregunta de admisión. — I answer every intake question. El clínico hace preguntas urgentes. — The clinician asks urgent questions. Trato de tranquilizar a la persona herida. — I try to reassure the injured person.

7
00:01:07.617 --> 00:01:17.366
Check your readiness. Explain the core idea. Produce an original example. Complete the section assessment at 85% or higher.
